 "text": "用于内置式永磁同步电机的基于转矩的磁场定向控制器，输入 7 路、输出 3 路；按 {Parameterize losses by} 指定类型 Single efficiency；{Control Type} 控制 Speed、{Stator resistance, Rs} 指定电阻、{D-axis inductance, Ld} 指定电感 1.7e-3、{Q-axis inductance, Lq} 指定电感 3.2e-3、{Permanent magnet flux, lambda_pm} 指定磁链、{Number of pole pairs, PolePairs} 指定极数、{Physical inertia, viscous damping, static friction, Mechanical} 指定惯量、阻尼、摩擦、{Motor constraint} 指定电机约束 Maximum、{Maximum current, I_max} 指定电流、{Maximum torque, T_max} 指定转矩、{MTPA table breakpoints, bp} 指定断点数、{Calculate MTPA Table Data} 指定派生参数、{Torque Breakpoints, T_mtpa} 指定派生、{D-axis table data, id_mtpa} 指定派生、{Q-axis table data, iq_mtpa} 指定派生、{D, Q, and max current limits, idq_limits} 指定派生、{Bandwidth of the current regulator, EV_current} 指定带宽、{Sample time for the torque control, Tst} 指定时间 5e-5、{Calculate Current Regulator Gains} 指定派生参数、{D-axis proportional gain, Kp_d} 指定派生、{Q-axis proportional gain, Kp_q} 指定派生、{D and Q axis integral gain, Ki} 指定派生、{Bandwidth of the motion controller, EV_motion} 指定带宽、{Bandwidth of the state filter, EV_sf} 指定带宽、{Calculate Speed Regulator Gains} 指定派生参数、{Proportional gain, ba} 指定派生、{Angular gain, Ksa} 指定派生、{Rotational gain, Kisa} 指定派生、{Speed regulation time constant, Ksf} 指定派生、{Inertia compensation, Jcomp} 指定派生、{Viscous damping compensation, Fv} 指定派生、{Static friction, Fs} 指定派生、{Overall inverter efficiency, eff} 指定常量、{Vector of speeds (w) for tabulated loss, w_loss_bp} 指定断点、{Vector of torques (T) for tabulated loss, T_loss_bp} 指定断点、{Corresponding losses, losses_table} 指定表、{Vector of speeds (w) for tabulated efficiency, w_eff_bp} 指定断点、{Vector of torques (T) for tabulated efficiency, T_eff_bp} 指定断点、{Corresponding efficiency, efficiency_table} 指定表，按实例取值。",
